{"hymn":"S600","parent":"E778","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Sigue cantando en fe","subtitle":"Oración—En fe","syl":{"n1":["Si","i"],"n2":["gue","t"],"n3":["can","i"],"n4":["tan","m"],"n7":["do‿en","t"],"n8":"fe,","n9":["Aun","i"],"n10":["que‿ha","m"],"n11":["ya‿os","m"],"n12":["cu","m"],"n13":["ri","m"],"n14":["dad;","t"],"n16":["A","i"],"n18":["la","m"],"n21":["ba‿a","t"],"n22":"Dios,","n25":"y","n26":"Él","n29":"tu","n30":"fe","n31":"En","n33":["vis","i"],"n34":["ta","t"],"n35":["cam","i"],"n36":["bia","m"],"n37":["rá.","t"],"n39":"En","n41":["vis","i"],"n44":["ta","t"],"n45":["cam","i"],"n46":["bia","m"],"n47":["rá.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Sigue cantando en fe,","Afirma el corazón;","La fe que alaba en noche atróz","//Es la que agrada a Dios.//"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Sigue cantando en fe,","Y Satanás huirá;","Que él no apague tu canción;","//Si alabas, vencerás.//"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Sigue cantando en fe,","Pronto amanecerá;","Saldremos a ver al Señor","//Con cántico eternal.//"]}]}